## 3. Phase 5 Completion Summary

Phase 5 has been fully implemented, trained, evaluated, and covered by automated unit tests:
1. **Physical Rules Engine** ([`src/detection/physical_rules.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/src/detection/physical_rules.py)): Hard kinematic bounds ($a \le 10\text{ m/s}^2$, $j \le 25\text{ m/s}^3$, $v \le 85\text{ m/s}$), HDOP/VDOP geometry bounds, and 4-tier severity levels (`INFO`, `WARNING`, `HIGH`, `CRITICAL`).
2. **Isolation Forest** ([`src/detection/isolation_forest.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/src/detection/isolation_forest.py)): Trained on 9,382 baseline records, persisted to [`models/isolation_forest.joblib`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/models/isolation_forest.joblib), calibrated normalized anomaly scores $[0.0, 1.0]$.
3. **XGBoost Detector Infrastructure** ([`src/detection/xgboost_detector.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/src/detection/xgboost_detector.py)): Supervised multi-class attack architecture with strict provenance safeguards.
4. **Temporal LSTM Autoencoder** ([`src/detection/temporal_model.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/src/detection/temporal_model.py)): Window size $W = 10$, strict session boundary preservation, per-feature error attribution, weights saved to [`models/temporal_model.pt`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/models/temporal_model.pt).
5. **Evidence Fusion Engine** ([`src/evidence/evidence_bundle.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/src/evidence/evidence_bundle.py)): Aggregates all 4 detector outputs into structured, immutable JSON evidence bundles in [`data/evidence/`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/data/evidence/).
6. **Documentation & Tests**: Detailed in [`docs/DETECTION_MODELS.md`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/docs/DETECTION_MODELS.md) and tested via [`tests/test_detection.py`](file:///c:/Users/New/Downloads/Logs/Logs/Task/locus_project/tests/test_detection.py).

